<%# The reader's own pending work, in the top bar.
    #
    # The right sidebar's panel answers "what is waiting" in detail, and the
    # **Pending changes** entry beside it answers "where are they". Both live in
    # the tools column, which is a drawer below `xl` — so on a tablet or a phone
    # the reader has to open something to learn whether anything is waiting at
    # all. This is the one statement of that state which is on every page and
    # needs nothing opened: one word, and a count when there is one.
    #
    # **It is deliberately not beside the page's own actions.** A page header's
    # row of buttons is about the page in front of the reader (slice, rename,
    # create); pending work belongs to the universe and outlives the page, which
    # is why it sits with the other global answers in `.navbar-actions` — before
    # the bell, because it is workspace state while a notification is addressed
    # to the person.
    #
    # **It renders at zero as well as at any count.** The entry is also the way
    # into the drafts list and its history, and a control that appears and
    # disappears with a count is a control whose absence needs explaining. The
    # same rule and the same gate are the sidebar panel's; what differs is only
    # where the answer is visible.
    #
    # **It counts, and does not decide.** The count is `draft_preview.count`,
    # which the sidebar panel and the universe page's own button also read, so
    # the three cannot disagree. Nothing here says an editing session is on or
    # off: a draft-based universe remembers every mutation whether the reader
    # pressed **Start editing** or not (ADR 0022), and an indicator that implied
    # otherwise would be the second answer to a question the mode already
    # answers.
    #
    # It is offered only where a draft can exist — a signed-in reader in a
    # universe that remembers changes rather than writing them — and follows the
    # drafts page's own `.active` / `aria-current="page"` rule, so it never claims
    # a page the reader is not on. %>
<% if draft_preview.available? %>
  <% pending_count = draft_preview.count %>
  <% on_drafts_page = controller_name == "drafts" %>
  <% indicator_aria = { label: [ t("drafts.indicator.label"), t("drafts.pending.count", count: pending_count) ].join(": ") } %>
  <% indicator_aria[:current] = "page" if on_drafts_page %>
  <%= link_to universe_drafts_path,
    class: "btn btn-outline-light btn-sm draft-indicator#{' active' if on_drafts_page}",
    title: t("drafts.pending.count", count: pending_count),
    aria: indicator_aria do %>
    <i class="bi bi-journal-text" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span><%= t("drafts.indicator.label") %></span>
    <% if pending_count.positive? %>
      <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light draft-indicator-count"><%= pending_count %></span>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
